## Third-party material referenced here

Quoted excerpts from upstream projects (OpenCore documentation, AMD_Vanilla
patches, Lilu/VirtualSMC, trulyspinach's SMCAMDProcessor, the NullMoth NVIDIA
driver) remain under their own licenses and are quoted for discussion. They are
not redistributed as part of this repository.

## A note on safety

Nothing here is warranted to work, and several procedures described (ESP writes,
kernel cache rebuilds, AC power cycles) can leave a machine unbootable. The
record documents what was done on one machine; reproducing it is your risk.
